  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to catalyse the market and strengthen the ecosystem for DRE-powered productive end-use applications &#x2013;creating and enhancing livelihood opportunities, particularly for women and vulnerable populations &#x2013;fostering local socio-economic growth in rural and remote areas. The proposed project also aims to support the development of a livelihoods transition framework for heavily coal dependent states (Odisha and Jharkhand). The approach adopted will be inclusive and gender resp</narrative>
  </description>
